"id":"rUXo5AsE","file":"tk_default_banners_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"中军大纛","missing":false},{"id":"LylVtFCG","file":"tk_default_banners_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"玄武旗","missing":false},{"id":"GAsVO8cZ","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}来得巧！看你这身气度，多半是为这次校场演武而来。这等大会，八方英豪齐聚，刀枪剑戟尽显锋芒，实乃我军中一大盛事也！","missing":false},{"id":"rqFKxm24","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}请了！若是为这演武而来，怕是要教你失望了。眼下黄巾猖獗，烽烟四起。单是这剿寇的差事，便已让官府焦头烂额，哪还有余暇筹办什么演武？","missing":false},{"id":"ZvzxcRbc","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}有礼！看你气度不凡，定是惯行沙场的豪杰。不知今日有何贵干，小人可否效力？","missing":false},{"id":"dgNCuuUL","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"哎呀，这不是{PLAYER.NAME}吗？久违了！今日再见，真是令人欣喜！","missing":false},{"id":"nmPaCLHp","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{FIGHT_DEBRIEF} {?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}可是还想再试一试？","missing":false},{"id":"j9RrkCvM","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"校场上如今正有演武大会吗？","missing":false},{"id":"W1wVPNpy","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这演武大会，我倒是有所耳闻……","missing":false},{"id":"GAq7KAf0","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"那是自然！瞧{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}这身架势，可不就是个练家子！不如也来参上一脚？说来这演武大会，在早年间可算得军中头等一件热闹事，只是到了光武皇帝那一朝，这等盛事却渐次荒废了。如今朝廷重整军规，虽不复旧时盛况，但每每举办，仍颇有看头。","missing":false},{"id":"VH27tpkT","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"此乃在军中扬名的绝好机缘！不过是豁出几颗牙罢了，天公造物有德，赐咱们三十来颗牙齿，不正是为这等场合留些备用的吗？","missing":false},{"id":"EA2JcVcb","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}可知，这演武大会由来已久！你瞧那校场里的旗杆，底下刻着“元鼎三年”几个字，那都是文皇帝还是武皇帝的时候了！若是再问往前还有没有，这可就说不上了，毕竟咱们也没那年岁去瞧个明白！[if:convo_merry]","missing":false},{"id":"EFKxbLaO","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"以前的演武大会，我小时候听我爷爷说起过，他又是听他爷爷讲的。那时候校场外旌旗招展，密如林海，风吹过来，猎猎作响，好似天际雷鸣。再看校场里，车马如云，铁蹄交错，卷起黄尘漫天；甲胄将士排列成阵，刀枪在日头下闪耀如雪，端的是威风凛凛！如此阵仗，别说练家子们争相献技，便是个平常人站在场边，也觉胸中豪气顿生！","missing":false},{"id":"LqkxF5Op","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"可惜到了光武皇帝那一朝，这演武大礼便渐渐废了。好在近几年，朝廷又重新整顿军伍，把这演武之事拾掇起来。可惜从前的盛况，是难以再现了。[if:convo_approving]","missing":false},{"id":"jy1o5cNT","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}看着便是练武出身！这演武大会，可是扬名立万的好机会。说来这边的太守也算慷慨，每次大会都会凑出一笔丰厚的赏银，以此鼓励军中英雄好汉前来较技！","missing":false},{"id":"iLuezAbk","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"即便没有大会，也不妨来此一趟。常有许多武人闲时在此练手，比划一番以保身手不生。校场里也不小气，胜者还能得上几枚赏钱，权作辛苦之酬。","missing":false},{"id":"aHGbTpLp","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"烦请曹掾说说这演武大会的规矩如何？","missing":false},{"id":"H2aaMAe5","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"不知这练手的规矩又是如何","missing":false},{"id":"7pH9MzS1","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"敢情这比武还要给咱们银子？不知这对朝廷又有何好处？","missing":false},{"id":"R2HP4EiX","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"多谢解答，在下已无疑问了。","missing":false},{"id":"k7ebznzr","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"哦？{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}但讲无妨。","missing":false},{"id":"bUmacxw7","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}有所不知，这演武，可不单是图个热闹场面，也是军中督训的重要法门。士兵技艺精不精，一上校场便见分晓。自从当年演武大礼被废，军中也就少了这等锻炼的机会，士兵的材力一年不如一年。我亲眼见过有的兵卒，连刀都不会拿，就那样直愣愣地被赶上了战场。如此这般，还怎么同贼寇拼杀？朝廷如今又在演武上慷慨解囊，免的是战场上吃大亏嘞！","missing":false},{"id":"o0H8Qs0D","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这演武大会的规矩，任你去哪个郡县，皆是一般无二。每回大会，皆由抽签决定对手，有时你需与人组队协同作战，有时却是独自一人单枪匹马。这般布置，便是要考校兵卒的真本事，无论是协同还是独斗，都要样样精通。","missing":false},{"id":"Jgkz4uo6","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"抽签不仅决定对手，还定下你要使的兵器。每场比试，胜者方能晋级，败者则止步。待到最后场上只余二人，便是一场高手较量，胜者才可称为魁首！","missing":false},{"id":"cPmV8S4e","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"平日里这校场也敞开，任谁都能进来练手。没有规矩，也无队伍之分，人人各凭本事，厮打到最后，只看谁能站着不倒。如此乱战，可不是别有一番趣味？{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}觉得如何？[ib:confident2]","missing":false},{"id":"WwbDoZXg","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这演武大会的赏钱到底有多少，可否告知？","missing":false},{"id":"Z4MreMZz","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"平日练手的赏钱又是多少，可否说明？","missing":false},{"id":"4vAbAIqi","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"好，我明白了，多谢指点。","missing":false},{"id":"Te4pxfWF","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"如此说来，我可否参与其中？","missing":false},{"id":"bBVLVT7L","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"那有何不可！瞧，场上已有几位好手在为大会热身了。若{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}有兴致，现在便可下场一试身手。若只是想练练拳脚，也可改日再来，不拘时候！[ib:warrior]","missing":false},{"id":"KtrZs3yA","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}既有此意，何愁无席之地？这校场向来敞开，凡是不怕吃苦头的好汉都能进来过招。瞧那边，已有几位兄弟在热身了。{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}若想下场厮打，现在便可去试一试；若要等演武大会，再来也是一样不迟！[ib:warrior]","missing":false},{"id":"ke0IvBXb","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}还有何不明之处？但凡小人知晓，定当为你解说清楚！","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_24","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}意下如何？不知今日想要作甚，小人可听候安排！","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_25","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"那便请曹掾将我的名字记入演武大会！","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_26","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"我想参与一场练手比试，还请曹掾安排。","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_27","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"附近的城镇里可还有演武大会正在进行？","missing":false},{"id":"iSNrQKEN","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"我想再问问之前提过的一件事……","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_30","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"此刻需得告辞了，多谢相待。","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_31","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{NEARBY_TOURNAMENT_STRING}","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_32","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"演武大会近期却是无信，{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}若是为此而来，恐怕要失望了。","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_33","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"去吧！下场之前，记得顺手拿一件练习兵器，好好施展一番！[if:convo_approving]","missing":false},{"id":"FguHzavX","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"如今校场正有演武大会进行，暂时不得练手。若要下场，需得等大会结束才行。","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_34","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"好！咱这就将{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}的大名写入签中。待到轮到你时，可要准备妥当，提兵上场，好生挥洒一番！[if:convo_merry]","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_35","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"正合我意！","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_36","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"今日身上怠倦，改日再来。","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_37","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"我自会准备妥当，静候出场！","missing":false},{"id":"arena_master_38","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"转念一想，还是算了。","missing":false},{"id":"GmIluR4H","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"好啊，我还没打痛快呢！","missing":false},{"id":"qsg7pZOs","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"多谢了，不过还是让我这身上的瘀伤先养一养再说吧。","missing":false},{"id":"Q7B68CVK","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}说的正是！伤养好了，日后再战未迟！[ib:normal]","missing":false},{"id":"1esi62Zb","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这大会乃官府筹办，每次必备厚礼，以示气派。或是一柄镶宝的名刃，寒光逼人；或是一匹良种战马，脚力绝佳。总之，都是剑士侠客梦寐以求之物，叫那些英雄豪杰见了也眼馋。","missing":false},{"id":"pinSMuMe","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这倒有。据闻{CLOSEST_TOURNAMENT}那边正要开一场，{NEXT_CLOSEST_TOURNAMENT}随后也有一场。若你脚程快些，这两处大会应当都能赶上。[ib:hip]","missing":false},{"id":"2WnruiBw","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"我听说{CLOSEST_TOURNAMENT}那边正要办一场演武大会，若你行程紧些，兴许还能赶得上。","missing":false},{"id":"tGI135jv","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"如今哪里还有什么演武大会？黄巾军肆虐四方，搅得世道不安，官府只求能稳住局势，已是万幸，哪里还有余暇操持什么演武？[ib:closed]","missing":false},{"id":"DqZtRBXR","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"你已受伤，正处于伪装状态。","missing":false},{"id":"yNMrF2QF","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"你已受伤。","missing":false},{"id":"jcEoUPCB","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"你正处于伪装状态。","missing":false},{"id":"Sph9Nliz","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"去和兵曹掾对话，他会告诉你关于校场的更多信息。","missing":false},{"id":"NESB0CVc","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"校场正举办演武大会，不能用于练习。","missing":false},{"id":"LL6GkIfg","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"若{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}能在倒下前击败{OPPONENT_COUNT_1}人，便可得赏{PRIZE_1}{GOLD_ICON}；若能斩落{OPPONENT_COUNT_2}人，则得{PRIZE_2}{GOLD_ICON}；倘若再勇猛些，连胜{OPPONENT_COUNT_3}人，可得{PRIZE_3}{GOLD_ICON}。若能撑到最后，击败{OPPONENT_COUNT_4}人，则赏{PRIZE_4}{GOLD_ICON}。倘若技压群雄，成为场上最后一人，那么{PRIZE_5}{GOLD_ICON}便尽收囊中。如何，这机会不差吧？","missing":false},{"id":"agIbuP9a","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"嗬！这点淤青，算得了什么？江湖好汉谁没在比试里吃过亏？关键是跌倒了能爬起来，拍拍身上的尘土，再鼓足劲儿接着斗。这才是硬汉的本事，也是当顶梁柱的人该有的气派！","missing":false},{"id":"o7I8qayN","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"哈！腹上一拳，倒也叫人清醒几分，活得有滋味！瞧你刚才，可是放倒了{OPPONENT_COUNT}个对手，算得上不俗的身手。只可惜，这还换不来什么赏银。依我看，你不如再回场上一趟，拿出真本事，好教众人开开眼界！","missing":false},{"id":"dxtuFW8b","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"方才你的表现当真不赖！几招几式颇见功底，虽说有些许疏漏，但已显出不小的潜力。你这一回，放倒了{OPPONENT_COUNT}个对手，可真算争气，依规拿了{PRIZE}{GOLD_ICON}赏钱。这般本事，日后定能更上一层楼！","missing":false},{"id":"923438xA","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"好，好！{PLAYER.LINK}，你这一回可是大显身手，足足撂倒了{OPPONENT_COUNT}个对手。场下众人看得津津有味，连连称道你的胆气和机巧。依规矩，这回你也得了{PRIZE}{GOLD_ICON}的赏钱，可真是风头一时无两！","missing":false},{"id":"EUmwEtap","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"好功夫，{PLAYER.LINK}！这一回，你可是一口气放倒了{OPPONENT_COUNT}个对手。如此身手，赏银自然少不了，依例得了{PRIZE}{GOLD_ICON}。这般战绩，可是叫人艳羡得很啊！","missing":false},{"id":"V0OMMQ1F","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"好一场威风凛凛的比试，{PLAYER.LINK}！只听得场上“啪！咔！”，你已将{OPPONENT_COUNT}个对手尽数打翻。场下观众无不喝彩叫好，这般英勇，自是当得起{PRIZE}{GOLD_ICON}的赏银！","missing":false},{"id":"pQ9Sxily","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"恭喜，英雄！方才那场比试，当真是精彩绝伦，教人难以忘怀！你能最后一人立于场上，自然不负众望，赢得这头筹大赏：{PRIZE}{GOLD_ICON}！","missing":false},{"id":"ocIutUyu","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"还有一事。咱们这校场，平日里钻研的便是战场上的诸般技艺。人在习练中往往会养成些习惯，若是觉得不合心意，想要换个法子重新修炼某项技能，我们这里也能助你一臂之力。","missing":false},{"id":"Y7tz9D28","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"那些教人精进技艺、改换习惯的教官……如何寻到他们，可否指点我一二？","missing":false},{"id":"NyWXSHH2","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"那是自然。不知此番是为你自己，还是为旁人打听？","missing":false},{"id":"3VxA6HaZ","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这是为在下自己所求。","missing":false},{"id":"1OKEl18y","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这是为{COMPANION.NAME}所求。","missing":false},{"id":"GvcotJmH","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下想请您助我家族中一人，精进技艺。","missing":false},{"id":"WRwA0VVS","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"不知{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}家族中何人需我指点技艺？","missing":false},{"id":"ElG1LnCA","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"这次是为旁人打听。","missing":false},{"id":"D33fIGQe","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"不必了，多谢。","missing":false},{"id":"95jXfam8","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}所求之技艺，究竟是属哪一类？","missing":false},{"id":"0G8Q3AZv","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下心中所想的是另一类技艺。","missing":false},{"id":"g0JOQQl0","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"此事暂且不必，改日再说吧。","missing":false},{"id":"pGyO41lb","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"小人晓得了。但仍不知{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}心中所指，究竟是哪一项技艺？","missing":false},{"id":"8PV1oB9W","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下欲专精于{SKILL_NAME}。","missing":false},{"id":"Z9pq58h4","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下心中所想的是另一项技艺。","missing":false},{"id":"CH7b5LaX","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下已改了主意。","missing":false},{"id":"q3J9Wb8N","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"若是{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}能付得起{GOLD_AMOUNT} {GOLD_ICON}，我便可立刻传授。不知{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}是否已拿定主意？","missing":false},{"id":"Q0UjYw7V","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下已拿定主意。","missing":false},{"id":"SLaJsVnq","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"其实，在下又改了主意。","missing":false},{"id":"IsBVxopm","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"甚好！不知{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}还有何事需我效劳？","missing":false},{"id":"aCGgBilx","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下还想请教另一项技艺的精进之法。","missing":false},{"id":"c4tfVgqb","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"在下想请您助我家族中另一位成员精进技艺。","missing":false},{"id":"Dz7E79QP","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"果是大有裨益，在下感激不尽，多谢。","missing":false},{"id":"FN3xNnd1","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{?PLAYER.GENDER}女侠{?}好汉{\\?}此项技艺经验尚浅，恐难尽善指点。不如另挑一门，或许更为合适。","missing":false},{"id":"wGAmNQGE","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"{CHARACTER.NAME}此项技艺经验尚浅，恐难尽善指点。不如另挑一门，或许更为合适。","missing":false},{"id":"xDikJxbO","file":"tk_default_arena_master_strings-zho-CN.xml","text":"你的同伴超出了部队上限，因此你一些同伴可能很快会离开。","missing":false}],"failures":[]}